# a format 21 project, from before polish (format 22): its master's EQ page held a fourth value nothing read. Here it is 127
# (a stray byte: the master list's old fourth name, "-", took any value) and the EQ's low is 70, for the migration's test
# (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy): polish takes its default, the rest of the master stays.
# Run by a format 21 build (b06215d): its soundplant_host tests/fixtures/make_v21.xy OUT
wait 300
bpm 99
mst lo 70
mst - 127
wait 40
projsave 1 v21_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v21.bin
